      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p00456",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "于是，他很有礼貌地把女人抱了起来，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "So, with great politeness, he lifted the woman up,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p00456",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "拂去了她身上的泥和雪，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "brushed the mud and snow from her body,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p00456",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "然后他没有回头看我一眼，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and then, without looking back at me even once,",
